  (text "DATASHEET: R401 = 2mOhm, +/-1%, 25ppm/K. INA228 address0x40; retain independent Kelvin pads2/3, force pads1/4." 
    (at 12.7 261.62 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.27 1.27)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "2eba0503-e6dd-5f68-8f45-01a999f0141c")) 
  (text "CALCULATED at5A: Vshunt10mV; dissipation50mW. Full scale81.92A at163.84mV range; alternate40.96mV gives20.48A nominal." 
    (at 12.7 266.7 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.27 1.27)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "819149be-0545-53ba-98e8-1c765cc8075b")) 
  (text "CALCULATED: 10ohm + 10ohm / 100nF differential filter pole79.6kHz. Telemetry is not the fast fault-current probe." 
    (at 12.7 271.78 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.27 1.27)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "291e2334-0ce9-5df5-8e2a-8b9201f9e11e")) 
  (text "CALCULATED: 80A would produce160mV and12.8W while flowing. Use measured integral(I^2 R dt); pulse survival OPEN." 
