    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.27 1.27)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "4e482708-42fd-5d2e-8c7d-76bc02526a42")) 
  (text "TP402/403 are Kelvin-only; TP405/406 expose force rails with paired local GND. No sense trace may carry load current." 
