    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.27 1.27)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "21b622d1-44be-54ee-91b3-0673bdd69324")) 
  (text "Host/local3.3V domains remain separate. 3V3_LOCAL is never protection permission. Disconnect J503 during initial faults." 
